 22:  * OpenMU never sends `WeatherStatusUpdate`, so the proxy synthesises it. This
 23:  * is the only place in the pipe that *originates* a packet rather than
 24:  * forwarding one - everything else here is a byte copy - so it is kept to one
 25:  * timer and one 4-byte frame.
