 35: /**
 36:  * Resend even when nothing changed, so a steady sky is self-healing: a client
 37:  * that connects mid-shower is told, and one that missed a frame is corrected
 38:  * within the interval rather than holding the wrong weather until the next
 39:  * change - which, on a soaked day, can be hours away.
 40:  */
