 43: /**
 44:  * Which servers this proxy is allowed to dial (see allowTargets.ts). Unset means
 45:  * any host the client asks for, which is what a local dev box wants; a proxy on
 46:  * the internet must be pinned to the game ports, or it is an open relay - and an
 47:  * internal target (127.0.0.1 and the like) must be pinned to an exact port, or a
 48:  * bare-host rule turns the relay into a way to reach every loopback service on
 49:  * the box, e.g. `ALLOW_TARGETS="127.0.0.1:44405,127.0.0.1:55901"`.
 50:  */
